data: {"type":"response.function_call_arguments.done","sequence_number":392,"item_id":"fc_066a1b303f9f4f48016adf761cf6008191b723d204a149ba23","output_index":1,"arguments":"{\"pointer\":\"/nodes/P\",\"coverage\":\"assessed\",\"judgment\":{\"verdict\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"The inspected root quantifies over every n:Nat and E:Set(V n), assuming exactly E.Nonempty and IsCompact E, and concludes the stated equality in ENNReal. Proof.lean:3-9 makes V n the real L2 space on Fin n and W n the real L2 space on Fin n ⊕ Unit; pack/projX/projT identify cyl with E×Icc(0,1). Splitting the sum of squared coordinate distances gives precisely the source Euclidean distance, not the max product metric. PiLp/WithLp contain only the underlying coordinate function, with no hidden proof assumption. Source-context D003-D005/D008 agree with coverCost/Hscale/Hmeasure/Hnative and native dimH: arbitrary countable covers, zero empty-member costs, no normalization factor, Borel native measure, and supremum over nonnegative exponents with infinite measure. T001 checks the finite-positive-scale/native bridge, including the extra infinite scale. Native dimH_empty is zero. T005 proves finiteness and the n=0 singleton case, rather than assuming either. T006 and T018-T020 cover n=0 and dimension zero. Auxiliary ULift spaces do occur; their cover transports, isometries, ediam and dimH transports are checked explicitly in T005-T007, T009, T013, T015, T017 and T019. Thus these do not change the endpoint or introduce an unchecked representation equivalence. The exported P has no residual internal theorem premises.\",\"locations\":[\"/endpoints/P/source\",\"/endpoints/P/actual\",\"/endpoints/P/correspondence\",\"/scope/full_target\",\"/scope/parameters\",\"/scope/hypotheses\",\"/documents/0\",\"/documents/1\",\"/documents/2\"]}}"}

